.IX Title "Clownfish::Hash 3pm"
.TH Clownfish::Hash 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Clownfish::Hash \- Hashtable.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 3
\&    my $hash = Clownfish::Hash\->new;
\&    $hash\->store($key, $value);
\&    my $value = $hash\->fetch($key);
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Values are stored by reference and may be any kind of Obj.
.SH CONSTRUCTORS
.IX Header "CONSTRUCTORS"
.SS new
.IX Subsection "new"
.Vb 3
\&    my $hash = Clownfish::Hash\->new(
\&        capacity => $capacity,  # default: 0
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Return a new Hash.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBcapacity\fR \- The number of elements that the hash will be asked to
hold initially.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS clear
.IX Subsection "clear"
.Vb 1
\&    $hash\->clear();
.Ve
.PP
Empty the hash of all key-value pairs.
.SS store
.IX Subsection "store"
.Vb 1
\&    $hash\->store($key, $value);
.Ve
.PP
Store a key-value pair.
.SS fetch
.IX Subsection "fetch"
.Vb 1
\&    my $obj = $hash\->fetch($key);
.Ve
.PP
Fetch the value associated with \f(CW\*(C`key\*(C'\fR.
.PP
Returns: the value, or undef if \f(CW\*(C`key\*(C'\fR is not present.
.SS delete
.IX Subsection "delete"
.Vb 1
\&    my $obj = $hash\->delete($key);
.Ve
.PP
Attempt to delete a key-value pair from the hash.
.PP
Returns: the value if \f(CW\*(C`key\*(C'\fR exists and thus deletion
succeeds; otherwise undef.
.SS has_key
.IX Subsection "has_key"
.Vb 1
\&    my $bool = $hash\->has_key($key);
.Ve
.PP
Indicate whether the supplied \f(CW\*(C`key\*(C'\fR is present.
.SS keys
.IX Subsection "keys"
.Vb 1
\&    my $arrayref = $hash\->keys();
.Ve
.PP
Return the Hash’s keys.
.SS values
.IX Subsection "values"
.Vb 1
\&    my $arrayref = $hash\->values();
.Ve
.PP
Return the Hash’s values.
.SS get_size
.IX Subsection "get_size"
.Vb 1
\&    my $int = $hash\->get_size();
.Ve
.PP
Return the number of key-value pairs.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Clownfish::Hash isa Clownfish::Obj.
